    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An Outstanding 4 Bed Detached Residence In A Most Desirable Area \n\nP N O'Gorman are delighted to present this distinctive detached residence, set amid private and mature gardens on Hospital Road, New Ross, close to New Ross Rugby Club and the Brandon House Hotel. Dating from the mid-1960s, this appealing bungalow offers buyers a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial home in one of the town's most sought-after residential areas. Extending to approximately 147 sq. m, the warm and welcoming accommodation is both spacious and well proportioned. The accommodation comprises an entrance hall, a generous living room with feature marble fireplace, sitting room/dining room, spacious kitchen with a cosy seating area, utility room, four bedrooms and two shower rooms. Outside, the property is approached by a generous gravelled driveway providing ample off-street parking. The extensive gardens are bordered by mature trees and hedging, creating a wonderful sense of privacy, while the sheltered rear garden offers plenty of space for outdoor dining, recreation and gardening. Combining generous accommodation, mature grounds and an exceptionally convenient location, this fine residence provides an excellent opportunity to create a wonderful family home within easy reach of New Ross town centre and its many amenities. Early viewing is highly recommended.\nAccommodation\nEntrance Porch\n\nEntrance Hall 2.9m x 2.4m \n\nLivingroom 4.8m x 4.7m with open fire\n\nSittingroom 4.8m x 3.6m \n\nKitchen 4m x 3.9m with range of fitted units open plan to \n\nStudy 2.9m x 2.8m\n\nUtility room 2.4m x 2.2m\n\nShower room 2m x 1.2m\n\nBedroom 1. 6m x 3m\n\nBedroom 2. 4.1m x 3.8m\n\nBedroom 3. 3.6m x 2.6m\n\nBedroom 4. 2.9m x 2.4m \n\nShower room 2.4m x 1.8m\n\nOUTSIDE: Mature gardens surround the property, ample off street parking to the front\nSERVICES: O.F.C.H. all other main services and alarm \nBER: E No 119697738\nEIRCODE: Y34WN60\nVIEWING: By prior appointment\n \n\n"
      },
